    "Hints use the owner's own syllable notation, approved 2026-11-28. Marks: ' = glottal stop (kept);",
    "H = kh; gh = gh; q = k; Q = kkh; tlh = tl; D = d; S = sh. Vowels: a = ah; e = eh open, e closed;",
